      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORE THAN MERRY (4) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but had to settle for a minor placing when a 3.5 lengths third over 352m at this track, clocking 19.70. Rates highly and will give a great sight. REDMAN JOHNNY (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (25.92) in a Restricted WIN at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Can measure up this time. BUSH BOODIE (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th on July 31 over 390m at this track behind Misty Rico beaten 7 lengths (22.43) in a Grade 5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. CASHED UP BETH (6) is a last-start placegetter who will have admirers.",
